in this household.

12:02.840 --> 12:06.676
There he is, Mr.
Former Sex Offender.

12:06.711 --> 12:08.377
Mom, it's not
that big a deal.

12:08.413 --> 12:10.513
All I did was finish
those creepy classes.

12:10.548 --> 12:12.648
