record is clear.

12:12.684 --> 12:14.917
You can go back to
being a normal boy

12:14.953 --> 12:16.719
and put all this
behind you.

12:16.754 --> 12:18.387
Hey, Chris, wait till
you see the funny thing

12:18.423 --> 12:20.156
I had 'em put
on your cake.

12:20.191 --> 12:22.358
"Happy sixth
birthday, Timmy"?

12:22.393 --> 12:24.060
Uh-oh, they must
have mixed them up.

12:24.095 --> 12:26.896
