far down your throat

18:42.041 --> 18:44.175
you'll be
my grip for a week!

18:44.210 --> 18:45.609
Warning, Mr. Griffin.

18:45.645 --> 18:48.012
Oh, you're warning me?!
I'm warning you!

18:48.047 --> 18:50.648
I'm gonna go to your house
and your wife!

18:50.683 --> 18:53.651
You proud of yourself,
tennis club security guard?

18:53.686 --> 18:55.486
Your kids look up to you?
Big man.

18:55.521 --> 18:57.888
Throwing out a baby and a dog.
Tough guy.

18:57.924 --> 19:00.324
Maybe I'll see you later when
you don't have that name tag on.

19:00.360 --> 19:01.726
I thought your
shot was in.

19:01.761 --> 19:03.494
Oh, hey, pound it, dude.

19:07.500 --> 19:09.500
So to find the area
of this circle,

19:09.535 --> 19:12.903
we're going to need to use pi,
whose digits go on forever.

19:12.939 --> 19:16.340
Can you imagine
if our pi was endless?

19:16.376 --> 19:18.709
We'd all be changing
our belt sizes.

19:20.747 --> 19:22.713
Thanks, Chris.

19:22.749 --> 19:24.348
Wow, that was
really something.

19:24.384 --> 19:25.850
Marcy?

19:25.885 --> 19:28.853
I had no idea you were
such an amazing tutor.

19:28.888 --> 19:30.287
And I really like
