19:30.323 --> 19:33.691
Thanks, but why are you
being so nice to me?

19:33.726 --> 19:35.693
You got me in so much
trouble before.

19:35.728 --> 19:37.695
Yeah, I'm really
sorry about that.

19:37.730 --> 19:39.930
That was just my dumb,
overprotective dad.

19:39.966 --> 19:41.332
Really?

19:41.367 --> 19:44.001
Yeah, he took my phone to look
at pictures of my friends,

19:44.037 --> 19:45.603
and he found the
one you sent.

19:45.638 --> 19:47.138
I bet that caught him
by surprise.

19:47.173 --> 19:48.439
Definitely.

19:48.474 --> 19:51.876
Well, I hope you know
that's not who I am anymore.

19:51.911 --> 19:55.813
I do, and I hope I didn't
cause you too much trouble.

20:02.088 --> 20:03.454
This is not a drill!

20:03.489 --> 20:05.322
I repeat, not a drill!

20:07.126 --> 20:09.527
Good to be back doing
this again, huh, Bill?

20:09.562 --> 20:11.362
What, shoveling
coal into a penis?

20:11.397 --> 20:12.496
I was sleeping.

20:14.000 --> 20:15.199
What's happening?!

20:15.234 --> 20:16.600
I don't know.

20:16.636 --> 20:18.769
Someone... someone get me
nude art books!

20:18.805 --> 20:20.871
I need nude art books!

20:20.907 --> 20:22.706
Oh, good, Chris.

20:22.742 --> 20:24.708
<i>You can hang this
New York Times back on...</i>

20:24.744 --> 20:27.478
Oh, a pee-pee!

20:31.317 --> 20:33.717
Well, Chris, you
killed that librarian,

20:33.753 --> 20:36.120
but we're glad to have you
back to your old self.

20:36.155 --> 20:38.756
Mrs. Lapardo worked at
that school for 54 years.

20:38.791 --> 20:40.391
Well, at least
she saw a little Wang

20:40.426 --> 20:41.725
before taking that dirt nap.

20:41.761 --> 20:43.060
Thanks, you guys.

20:43.096 --> 20:46.163
I guess chemical castration
isn't for everyone.

20:46.199 --> 20:49.166
I-Is that... is that
the lesson for this week?

20:49.202 --> 20:52.491
Uh, I guess it's that or
be kinder on the tennis court.

20:53.260 --> 20:54.659
Where have you been?

20:54.739 --> 21:01.239
Thank you for watching "Family Guy" on
www.FOX-fan.ru